Package: mysterymodel
Title: Opinionated Workflow for Clinical Prediction Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tyler", "Muffly", email = "tyler.muffly@dhha.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An orchestration layer for clinical prediction modelling.
    Established engines do the statistics: 'rms' for regression, internal
    validation, calibration and nomograms, the 'easystats' packages for
    diagnostics and interpretation, and 'tidymodels' for resampling and model
    comparison. This package supplies the workflow holding them together and
    the methodological safeguards that keep a published model honest. It makes
    no model-selection decision on the analyst's behalf and hides none.
